  "comment": "Policy 44, DEV CHANNEL ONLY. app_update points at drawbridge 0.2.8 build 24, which starts the web filter at provisioning rather than at the lock. Policy content is unchanged from 43. The reasoning is in design-decisions: the old rule was inconsistent, because if 'not locked' meant 'not filtered' then unlocking would have to un-filter the phone, and it never did. Must not be merged to main as it stands: app_update names build 24 and a dev URL.",
